# .sources-allow — exemptions from .github/workflows/no-committed-sources.yml
# One glob per line; the reason after '#' must name the ground: own authorship,
# or the licence that permits redistribution. A third-party book or journal
# article never belongs here — read from a local copy, cite by edition and page.

*DESCRIPTION_obsgermany_*.pdf           # DWD open-data documentation, GeoNutzV / CC BY 4.0; mirrored from the practice repo, attribution carried there
*easyprivacy.txt                        # EasyPrivacy filter list, CC BY-SA 3.0; attribution in the pipeline's notice
*archive/trace/*.md                     # own trace output of a practice, not a source text
